<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Section>剧本默认配置</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Section>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Description>新建游戏会使用以下配置。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Description>

  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFaction.Subsection>派系</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFaction.Subsection>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFactionRelations.Label>派系关系</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFactionRelations.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFactionRelations.Description>决定与所有派系的初始关系模式。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.OrdinaryFactionRelations.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.FactionOutpost.Label>派系前哨生成频率</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.FactionOutpost.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.FactionOutpost.Description>决定派系前哨的自然生成频率。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.FactionOutpost.Description>

  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.HostileFactions.Subsection>机械巢与虫巢</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.HostileFactions.Subsection>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveRelation.Label>与机械巢关系</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveRelation.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveRelation.Description>决定与机械巢的初始关系模式。仅在存在机械巢派系时生效。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveRelation.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveNode.Label>机械巢节点生成频率</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveNode.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveNode.Description>决定机械巢节点的自然生成频率。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.MechHiveNode.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.InsectRelation.Label>与虫巢关系</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.InsectRelation.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.InsectRelation.Description>决定与虫巢派系的初始关系模式。仅在存在虫巢派系时生效。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.InsectRelation.Description>

  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Routes.Subsection>剧情路线</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Routes.Subsection>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.Label>肃清指令</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.Description>决定新存档是否启用肃清指令路线。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.DisabledReason>只有将机械巢关系设为“盟友”后才能启用肃清指令。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.PurgeDirective.DisabledReason>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.Label>共生盟约</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.Description>决定新存档是否启用共生盟约路线。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.DisabledReason>当前派系关系被永久锁定，不满足共生盟约的启用条件。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.SymbiosisCovenant.DisabledReason>

  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Ideology.Subsection>文化适配</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.Ideology.Subsection>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.IdeologyAdaptation.Label>文化适配程度</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.IdeologyAdaptation.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.IdeologyAdaptation.Description>决定机械族机械师使用的文化适配等级。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.GeneralScenarioDefaults.IdeologyAdaptation.Description>
</LanguageData>
